  "worked_solution": "We multiply each row in the matrix by the column vector using the dot product: \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}By & =[\\begin{aligned}b & b \\\\ c & c\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}3 \\\\ 4\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}b\\cdot 3+b\\cdot 4 \\\\ c\\cdot 3+c\\cdot 4\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}3b+4b \\\\ 3c+4c\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}7b \\\\ 7c\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$",
